## kokudaka, the 1591 Castilian census, Beloch/Malanima's Italy, N. D. Cook's
## Peru, Cook & Borah's Mexico, Reid's South-East Asia, HYDE 3.3 (corrected)
## for Africa. Generated by the research's converter; regenerate rather than
## edit by hand. (Regions.POPULATION_K still spreads the provinces — the map's
## shapes — and is the fallback for a zone missing here.)

